cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "BSciLib: a machine-checked library of behavioral theory"
message: "If you use BSciLib, please cite it using this metadata."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Cox
    given-names: David J.
repository-code: "https://github.com/bscilib/bscilib"
abstract: >-
  A Lean 4 library of derivations in quantitative behavior analysis, together
  with an executable Python layer for schedule semantics, structural
  identifiability, and metamorphic testing. Every theorem is stated as an
  implication over named, documented assumption modules; the library asserts no
  empirical claim.
keywords:
  - behavior analysis
  - formal verification
  - Lean 4
  - reproducibility
  - structural identifiability
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.1.0-dev
